  "notes": [
    "Phase 1: no rig, weights or animations. Same keys as the Toybox heroes / Kitsune / Kazemaru / Mikan joints.json.",
    "head = the head-ball centre (the radial origin), not the nod pivot; head_base = a suggested nod pivot at the base of the skull.",
    "Head skin = zero surface of one smooth implicit field (skull + cheek ruff + tufts + muzzle + chin + nose), analytic normals; no eye sockets.",
    "Mouth: a sculpted U smile groove (closed) with 5 loops round it; the skin is cut along the parting (see mouth).",
    "Eyelid holes ringed by 6 loops each, the rim rolled in behind separate lens eyeballs; 5 loops round the nose.",
    "Lashes: FoxC_lash_L / _R, thick rolls on the skin over each opening with three flicks (origin = the eye centre): weight 100% to lidU.",
    "Ears: separate pieces (FoxC_ear_L / _R), bend rows from the root (in the skull) to the tip; pivot = ears.base.",
    "Satchel: FoxC_satchel (bag, flap, band): weight the bag to hips / the left thigh lightly, the band to chest.",
    "Tail: a separate piece (FoxC_tail), 22 bend rings from the root to the tip; pivot = tailRoot; chain = tail.",
    "Sleeves: separate shells with 9 rings each. Dress: one shell (12 rings) + the rolled hem."
  ]
